In some ways, but also the idea that you're exploring caves and stuff this time instead of a jungle.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:01.500
Okay. Pitfall 1 is all in a jungle.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:09.100
Yeah. And then in the manual for Super Pitfall, there's a tips and tricks section, you know, towards like the end of it.

