It's not essential. The mechanics are bad.

00:48:48.980 --> 00:48:50.340
This is a bad game.

00:48:51.260 --> 00:48:54.760
Sean? Super Pitfall is inessential.

00:48:55.600 --> 00:48:59.440
It's a great example of how not to design a video game, though.

00:49:00.020 --> 00:49:01.960
So check it out if you want to know that.

00:49:03.100 --> 00:49:05.180
Joe? Have you ever had a nightmare?

00:49:06.380 --> 00:49:10.480
And this game is like playing through a nightmare in a lot of ways.

00:49:10.700 --> 00:49:12.700
So you're trying to run somewhere.

00:49:12.860 --> 00:49:14.260
It's hard to get there.

00:49:14.480 --> 00:49:15.340
You're trying to jump.

00:49:15.520 --> 00:49:18.540
You can't really jump where you were trying to go.

00:49:18.960 --> 00:49:20.600
Enemies are just popping out of nowhere.

00:49:20.760 --> 00:49:22.180
The ceiling's falling on you.

00:49:22.940 --> 00:49:24.840
I have more and I can't think of it now.

00:49:24.920 --> 00:49:27.560
The pyramids just show up in people's dreams a lot.

00:49:27.840 --> 00:49:30.240
The pyramids just show up.

