You have a weapon, but you can't really attack.

00:49:33.800 --> 00:49:34.920
You're trying to attack.

00:49:35.040 --> 00:49:36.460
You can't actually attack anything.

00:49:36.720 --> 00:49:38.880
And then at the end, you finally finish it.

00:49:38.940 --> 00:49:40.540
And it just says, please try again.

00:49:40.680 --> 00:49:42.020
You just have to start over.

00:49:42.380 --> 00:49:44.540
And meanwhile, that haunting song.

00:49:44.760 --> 00:49:46.820
Yeah, one song over and over again.

00:49:47.500 --> 00:49:50.720
There was just nothing enjoyable about this game.

00:49:50.860 --> 00:49:51.700
So I'm going to say no.

